# stark_log options, shown in the single STARK menu: main/Kconfig.projbuild
# sources this file (ARCHITECTURE.md §9). STARK-0206.

config STARK_LOG_RING_BYTES
    int "Log capture ring (bytes)"
    range 0 16384
    default 4096
    help
        Every console line is also copied into a static ring of this many
        bytes, which the storage service writes to the card's log file.
        Lines logged before the card mounts wait here, so the boot log
        reaches the file; when the ring is full the oldest whole lines go
        (and are counted). 0 turns capture off.
